        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/f023b572d212dea4e1f673ee150ecfaa.avif?t=1766658408\" width=200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free desktop casual healing game that requires no extra operations. As long as you use your keyboard and mouse, you can simultaneously &quot;cultivate&quot; and accumulate merit points. These points can be used to randomly draw a wide variety of appearance costumes. You can change its look at any time, adding a little fun to your work and life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/04c888cb766646cebad8109fed916957.avif?t=1766658408\" width=500 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired after a long day at work? Take a few consecutive draws—joy will follow right away! If you're lucky, you might even get the legendary appearance. If you like it, recommend it to your friends too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/489835b69d5df3e7d5955ccc43763704.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/099b5f51cec2ad733ef587b1f84b9392.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/e9988605df33eda05c7775be6f1a6c33.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/c2382d2fe04381f3de08df0850cfcf13.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of cute outfits for you to change freely, and of course, all you need to do is type a little more!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/f023b572d212dea4e1f673ee150ecfaa.avif?t=1766658408\" width=200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free desktop casual healing game that requires no extra operations. As long as you use your keyboard and mouse, you can simultaneously &quot;cultivate&quot; and accumulate merit points. These points can be used to randomly draw a wide variety of appearance costumes. You can change its look at any time, adding a little fun to your work and life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/04c888cb766646cebad8109fed916957.avif?t=1766658408\" width=500 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired after a long day at work? Take a few consecutive draws—joy will follow right away! If you're lucky, you might even get the legendary appearance. If you like it, recommend it to your friends too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/489835b69d5df3e7d5955ccc43763704.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/099b5f51cec2ad733ef587b1f84b9392.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/e9988605df33eda05c7775be6f1a6c33.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835910/extras/c2382d2fe04381f3de08df0850cfcf13.avif?t=1766658408\" width=171 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of cute outfits for you to change freely, and of course, all you need to do is type a little more!</p>",
        "short_description": "The super cute capybara will stay with you. Every time you tap the keyboard or click the mouse, it'll mimic the same taps to accumulate merit points. Merit lets you randomly draw diverse looks to switch freely. Don't hesitate—add a super versatile capybara to your desktop now!",
